    /// Acquire full-screen exclusive mode for a swapchain.
    ///
    /// Calls the C command
    /// [`vkAcquireFullScreenExclusiveModeEXT`](https://docs.vulkan.org/refpages/latest/refpages/source/vkAcquireFullScreenExclusiveModeEXT.html)
